  "releaseNotes": "- Includes all stability fixes from the unpublished beta.33 and beta.34\n  candidates: approval recovery, model-access renewal, workspace lifecycle,\n  WebSocket cancellation and concurrent local sandbox metadata updates\n- Aligns automatic Cube Runtime downloads with installer Runtime\n  `1.0.0-beta.15`, preventing upgraded services from resolving the old Runtime\n- Adds a release regression guard requiring the Cube default, installer\n  Runtime version and Runtime tag to agree\n- Public SDK contracts and the Harness environment remain unchanged from\n  the beta.34 candidate; no new Runtime image rebuild is required\n\n### Verification\n\n- Passed type checks, production build and 453 automated tests\n- Retains the beta.34 VMM race, browser refresh and real Harness verification\n- Large-scale 2000-user capacity is not certified by this release",
